<title>POLAND: Polish Dec 1996 unemployment inches up to 13.6 pct.</title>
<headline>Polish Dec 1996 unemployment inches up to 13.6 pct.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Registered unemployment in Poland rose to 13.6 percent of the workforce in December from 13.3 percent in November, but was lower than 14.9 percent in 1995, figures from the Central Statistical Office (GUS) show.</p>
<p>   POLISH UNEMPLOYMENT     DEC 1996    NOV 1996    DEC 1995</p>
<p> number of jobless million   2.36	 2.31	    2.63</p>
<p> pct of workforce	    13.6	 13.3	    14.9</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
